Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.91,0:00:07.51,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}好了，开始了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Okay, here we go.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.54,0:00:10.38,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}首播之夜，《永恒》，对吧？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Opening night, "Everlasting," all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.41,0:00:12.45,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}给他们看点他们想看的！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Let's give 'em something that they want!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.48,0:00:14.62,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}小马！公主！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Ponies! Princesses!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.65,0:00:16.15,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}浪漫！爱情。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Romance! Love.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.18,0:00:18.35,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我不知道，反正全是一堆垃圾。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I don't know, it's all a bunch of crap, anyways.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.39,0:00:19.45,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}大家动起来。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Let's go, people.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.49,0:00:22.26,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}姑娘们马上就到。紧张吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}The girls are about to arrive. Are you feeling nervous?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.29,0:00:23.56,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}算不上，不紧张。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I wouldn't say so, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.59,0:00:25.59,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}那就是兴奋？当然。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Excited, then? Absolutely.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.63,0:00:26.79,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}很好，我准备好了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Good. I'm ready.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.83,0:00:29.23,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}那就好……因为她们来了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Well, that's good... because here they come.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.52,0:00:54.09,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你好，你好。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Hello, there. Hi.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.12,0:00:55.22,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我叫莎米卡。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I'm Shamiqua.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.26,0:00:56.62,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}莎米卡？好。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Shamiqua? Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.66,0:00:58.19,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}好，行了。我觉得拍到了。卡！卡！卡！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Okay. There we go. I think I got it. Cut! Cut! Cut!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.23,0:01:00.09,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}卡了！卡了！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}That's a cut! That's a cut!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.13,0:01:02.16,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}所有人回到原位！快点！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Everybody, back to one, please! Let's hustle!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.20,0:01:03.20,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}该死！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Damn it!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.23,0:01:06.27,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}莎米卡？你就选她？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Shamiqua? That's your girl?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.30,0:01:08.70,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}就是你说有当老婆潜质的那个？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}That's the one who you said had wife potential?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.74,0:01:09.84,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}她是黑人。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}She's black.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.87,0:01:11.44,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}她很美，上的是斯佩尔曼学院。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}She's gorgeous. She went to Spelman.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.47,0:01:12.74,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}行了，你知道吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Okay, you know what?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.77,0:01:15.58,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}第一个下车的女孩永远是老婆料，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}First girl out of the carriage is always a wifey,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.61,0:01:17.54,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}而她不是老婆料。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}and that is not a wifey.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.58,0:01:19.25,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}白宫里都有黑人了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}There's a black man in the White House.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.28,0:01:21.15,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}哦，多谢了。我知道，行吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Oh, thank you so much. I know, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.18,0:01:22.68,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}而且他也不算纯黑人，好吧？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}And he's barely black, all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.72,0:01:26.12,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}美国种族歧视又不是我的错，各位。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}It is not my fault that America's racist, people.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.15,0:01:28.39,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}好了，丹，开始吧。换个新女孩上来。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Okay, Dan, let's go. Get a new girl out here.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.42,0:01:29.36,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}快点，快点。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Hustle, hustle.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.39,0:01:30.72,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}好，明白。唉！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Okay, got it. Ugh!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.76,0:01:32.76,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-三号车在哪？  -没看见。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-Where's Limo Three?   -Haven't seen it.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.79,0:01:34.50,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}三号车在哪？我不知道。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Where's Limo Three? I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.53,0:01:36.26,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}没人知道？“我不知道”？三号车。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Nobody? "I don't know"? Limo Three.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.30,0:01:39.20,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你最好是在给我突破音障，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Um, you'd better be breaking the damn sound barrier,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.23,0:01:41.24,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}因为我们现在就要你到场。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}because we need you here right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.27,0:01:43.27,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}三号车？我真是……谢谢。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Uh, Limo Three? I can't even... Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.30,0:01:46.34,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}“我们已经在拍了”这句话你哪部分没听懂？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}What part of "we are rolling" did you not understand?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.37,0:01:49.34,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我们快到了。你晚到一秒都在烧我们的制作费。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}We're almost there. Your costing our production every second you're not here.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.38,0:01:50.74,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你知道，我们航班延误了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You know, our flight was delayed.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.78,0:01:52.71,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}昆恩，我本事很大，但控制不了天气。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I can do a lot, Quinn, but I can't control the weather.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.75,0:01:54.32,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}马上给我滚过来。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Just get your ass in here now.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.35,0:01:56.92,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}嘿，那个小个子姑娘，我真的要上厕所……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Hey, um, tiny girl, I really have to pee, here...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.95,0:01:57.92,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}很急的那种。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Like, bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.95,0:02:00.25,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}是啊，我也控制不了天气，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Yeah, I can't really control the weather, either,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.29,0:02:01.46,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你懂我意思吧。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}if you know what I mean.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.49,0:02:03.52,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}其实我也想去。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You know, I could actually go, as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.56,0:02:05.39,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}好了，姑娘们，我们还有，呃，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Okay, uh, well, ladies, we are just, um,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.43,0:02:06.63,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}几分钟就到了，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}a few minutes away,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.66,0:02:08.33,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}所以想知道追求者是谁吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}so do you want to know who the suitor is?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.36,0:02:09.46,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}天啊！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Oh, my gosh!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.50,0:02:10.60,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}当然想！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Uh, yes?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.63,0:02:12.23,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}他叫亚当·克伦威尔。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}His name is Adam Cromwell.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.27,0:02:15.27,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}他是克伦威尔酒店帝国的英国继承人。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}He is the British heir to the Cromwell Hotel fortune.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.30,0:02:16.80,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}天啊！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Oh, my gosh!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.84,0:02:18.77,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}什么？！亚当·克伦威尔？！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}What?! Adam Cromwell?!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.81,0:02:21.21,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我的天！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Oh, my God!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.31,0:02:23.41,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}真是太……亚当·克伦威尔？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}That is absolutely... Adam Cromwell?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.44,0:02:24.41,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}太好了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}That's great.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.44,0:02:27.55,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}天啊，他太可口了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Oh, my God. He's so yummy.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.58,0:02:28.88,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你们……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You guys...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.92,0:02:30.25,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我的……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Oh, my...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.28,0:02:31.75,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}他真的有……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}He's got real...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.78,0:02:35.42,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}天啊，天啊。听我说。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Oh, my God. Oh, my God. Listen to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.46,0:02:38.83,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}把他弄醒。他那样子像是宁可在嚼草料，也不想见美女。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Wake him up. He looks like he'd rather be chewing cud than meeting hot girls.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.86,0:02:42.30,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}先别拍。先别拍。停一下。所以我刚才，呃……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Hold the roll. Hold the roll. Hold the roll. So, I just, uh...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.33,0:02:44.40,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}制作人希望你表现得再迷人一点\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Um, producers want you to act a little bit more charming
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.43,0:02:45.77,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}下一条，我们要再来一遍。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}on the next take, so we're gonna roll again.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.80,0:02:46.93,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}再迷人一点？对。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}More charming? Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.97,0:02:48.74,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}好，行。行吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Right. Okay. Okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.77,0:02:50.87,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}随便吧。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Oh, whatever.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.90,0:02:52.67,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}乖乖当个听话的木偶，照我说的做。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Just be a good meat puppet and do as I say.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.71,0:02:54.21,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}三号车刚到。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Uh, Limo Three just arrived.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.24,0:02:57.68,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}好。三号，马上进来。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Oh, good. Okay, get in here right now, Three.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.71,0:02:59.55,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}好了姑娘们，手机交出来，马上。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}All right, ladies, phones, now.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.58,0:03:01.35,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你们不会想看我八周没手机的样子。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You don't want to see me with no phone for eight weeks.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.38,0:03:02.88,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}是啊，运气好是八周。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Yeah, eight weeks if you're lucky.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.92,0:03:04.42,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}运气不好就一晚。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}One night if you're not.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.45,0:03:05.92,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}好吧，八周。哇。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Okay, so eight weeks. Wow.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.86,0:03:10.52,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}嘿，瑞秋，我们能去下洗手间吗？姑娘们。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}H-Hey, Rach, can we use the bathroom? Ladies.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.56,0:03:12.53,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我没发话，谁都不许离开这辆车。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Do not move from this limo until I tell you.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.56,0:03:13.93,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}谢了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.96,0:03:15.80,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}瑞秋，那洗手间怎么办？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Uh, Rachel, what about the bathroom?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.83,0:03:17.66,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}别让她们下这辆车，行吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Don't let them leave from this limo, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.70,0:03:19.53,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}收到。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Copy that.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.81,0:03:29.54,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你们俩，拍她进来的时候，好吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You guys, get her when she's coming in, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.58,0:03:30.94,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}出来的镜头也要拍。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Cover her coming out.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.88,0:03:36.98,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}糟了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Oh, crap.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.92,0:03:40.69,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}那是……？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Is that...?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.72,0:03:42.92,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}没错，你男友的前女友。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Yep, your boyfriend's ex.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.66,0:03:47.53,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}什么？你们真的要一直用斯坦尼康\N{\rEN\blur0.8}What? What, you guys really need to be on Steadicam
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.56,0:03:48.96,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}全程拍我吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}this whole time, shooting me?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.00,0:03:51.46,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}太荒唐了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}This is ridiculous.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.50,0:03:53.30,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}欢迎回到现实，瑞秋。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Welcome back to reality, Rachel.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.33,0:03:54.94,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}瑞秋就是那个神秘的自由职业者？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Rachel's the mystery freelancer?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.97,0:03:56.84,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}惊喜吧。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Surprise.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.87,0:03:58.37,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}难以置信。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Unbelievable.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.41,0:04:00.84,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}是啊，害怕吧，好吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Yeah. Be afraid, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.87,0:04:02.28,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}疯婆子回来了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Crazy's back.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.31,0:04:04.01,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}大家别一窝蜂冲上来抱我啊。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Don't everybody rush to hug me at one time.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.04,0:04:05.85,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I'm...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.38,0:04:10.38,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}糟了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Shit.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.83,0:04:26.60,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}又来了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Here we go.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.63,0:04:28.04,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}啊。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Ahh.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.07,0:04:30.27,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这下要有意思了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}It's about to get interesting.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.40,0:04:33.87,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-哦，对啊！  -耶，欢迎回来，瑞秋。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-Oh, yeah!   -Yay, welcome back, Rachel.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.01,0:04:36.81,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}镜头前那出挺漂亮。真不错。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Nice with the cameras. That was nice.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.84,0:04:38.35,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}哦，我的荣幸，我的荣幸。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Oh, my pleasure, my pleasure.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.38,0:04:41.75,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}哎哟哟，看看猫把什么拖回家了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}My, my, my, look what the cat dragged home.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.78,0:04:44.08,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我以为……我是说，你不是……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I thought... I mean, weren't you...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.12,0:04:45.49,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}还在察看期？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}On probation?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.52,0:04:47.42,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}是啊，我还在做社区服务呢。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Yeah, and I'm doing community service.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.46,0:04:48.76,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我还在等\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I'm still waiting
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.79,0:04:50.46,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}民事起诉的庭审，不过。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}on the, uh, trial for the civil charges, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.49,0:04:53.59,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}还有，我最后几个女孩的补拍是你做的？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}And, um, and you did the pickups on the last of my girls?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.63,0:04:55.36,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}没人告诉我她们是你的……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Nobody told me they were your...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.40,0:04:57.86,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}对，对，她们不是夏雅的，是你的，行吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Y-Yeah, they're not Shia's. They're yours, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.90,0:04:59.37,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}给你。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Here you go.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.40,0:05:00.77,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}夏雅，你还有别的女孩。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}And, Shia, you have other girls.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.80,0:05:02.57,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}是啊，但好苗子都归她？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Yeah, but she gets the best ones?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.60,0:05:03.60,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}至少两个能留到最后的。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}At least two stayers.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.64,0:05:05.77,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你还签不下来。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Who you couldn't close.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.81,0:05:07.81,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我让瑞秋飞过去说服那个律师\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I had Rachel fly out and convince the lawyer
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.84,0:05:09.71,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}和那个辣妈签了合同。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}and the MILF to sign their contracts.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.74,0:05:10.91,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}所以今晚，我要你四处走动，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}So tonight, I want you floating,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.94,0:05:12.58,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}说不定你能把你的一条烂鱼\N{\rEN\blur0.8}and maybe you can turn one of your dogs
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.61,0:05:14.92,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}变成黑马，好吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}into a dark horse, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.95,0:05:17.35,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}好了，我现在要三号车的女孩，快点。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}All right, I need the girls from Limo Three now, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.38,0:05:19.49,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}昆恩，你能下来一趟吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Quinn, can you come down here, please?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.52,0:05:20.95,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我们这儿有点状况。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}We have kind of a situation.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.99,0:05:23.59,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}妈的。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Crap.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.62,0:05:25.99,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}好，我这就来，而且我很火。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}All right, I'm on my way, and I'm pissed.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.03,0:05:29.43,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}呃，我们出了点状况。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Uh, we got a situation.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.66,0:05:33.63,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我真的要上厕所。你们不想去吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I really have to pee. Do you guys have to go?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.67,0:05:35.10,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我从机场就憋着了。对对对。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I've had to since the airport. Yeah, yeah, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.14,0:05:37.60,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}是啊，我知道，他们一直没让我们下车。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Yeah. I know, they haven't let us out at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.64,0:05:38.67,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你没事吧？你怎么样？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Are you okay? How you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.71,0:05:39.77,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我很好。很好。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I'm good. Good.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.81,0:05:41.07,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}是啊，我是说，你知道，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Yeah, I mean, you know,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.11,0:05:42.51,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}回来感觉有点不真实，不过……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}it's a little bit surreal being back, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.54,0:05:43.64,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}太近了！是啊，但是什么？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Too close! Yeah, but what?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.68,0:05:44.91,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你准备好上场了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You're ready to get out there.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.94,0:05:45.95,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我想是吧。我……好。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I think so. I... Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.98,0:05:47.45,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你知道，昆恩，我只是……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You know, Quinn, I just...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.48,0:05:48.78,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我的心理医生说我不能再\N{\rEN\blur0.8}My therapist says that I can't really travel
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.82,0:05:49.98,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}出差更多了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}any more than I already have.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.02,0:05:51.45,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我是说，我得按时\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I mean, I have to keep a schedule,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.48,0:05:52.72,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}去做咨询。好，行，没问题。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}make my appointments. Yeah, okay, fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.75,0:05:54.05,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你知道，我是认真……好，出差，不出差。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You know, I'm seri... Okay, travel. No travel.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.09,0:05:55.42,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}随便吧。呃，里卡多在哪？！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Whatever. Uh, where's Ricardo?!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.46,0:05:57.16,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}喂？！没人吗？！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Hello?! Nobody?!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.19,0:05:58.56,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}好了，听着！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}All right, listen!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.59,0:06:01.43,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我要十倍的柱状蜡烛，各位！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I need 10 times more pillar candles, people!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.46,0:06:03.63,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}十倍！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}10 times!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.66,0:06:04.70,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}哇。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Wow.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.73,0:06:06.47,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}他们都一脸“啥？”地看着我。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}They're all looking at me like, "huh?"
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.50,0:06:08.40,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你知道，昆恩，我也真的很想谢谢你。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You know, Quinn, I also really want to thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.44,0:06:09.70,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}让开！别谢我，行吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Move! Don't thank me, all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.74,0:06:10.94,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}报答我就行。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Just repay me.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.97,0:06:12.07,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你捅了那么大娄子，欠我一大笔。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You owe me big-time after the mess you made.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.10,0:06:13.57,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}好了各位，先停工。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Okay, everybody, hold the work.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.61,0:06:15.01,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我们现在试试这个摇臂，拜托。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}We're gonna try this crane now, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.04,0:06:17.88,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我真不敢相信我还得再问一遍，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I can not believe that I have to ask this again,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.91,0:06:19.18,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}三号车在哪？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}but where is Limo Three?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.21,0:06:20.85,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我们就卡在那儿。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}We are holding on that.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.88,0:06:23.12,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}问题是亚当……我们找不到他。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}The thing is Adam... We can't find him.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.15,0:06:24.18,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}什么？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.22,0:06:26.55,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}是啊。唉。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Yeah. Ugh.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.59,0:06:28.46,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}切特来了。哦，太好了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Chet's here. Oh, great.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.49,0:06:30.12,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}就……大家都装作一切正常。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Just... everybody act like everything's fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.16,0:06:33.96,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}对。切特·威尔顿，《永恒之恋》的创造者，大老板。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Yep. Chet Wilton, creator of "Everlasting," big kahuna.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.99,0:06:36.20,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}别担心，莉琪。过来，亲我一下。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Don't worry, Lizzie. Come here. Give me a kiss.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.23,0:06:38.03,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}嗯。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Mmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.06,0:06:39.47,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我听说我们有点状况。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I hear we have a situation.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.50,0:06:40.83,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我不知道你在这儿。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I didn't know you were here.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.87,0:06:43.00,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}哦，我在器材车上跟哥们儿混着呢。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Oh, I'm hanging out with my homeys in the grip truck.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.04,0:06:44.20,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我的王室成员呢？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Where's my royalty?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.24,0:06:46.97,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}呃，要不你来回答？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Um, maybe you'd like to answer that?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.01,0:06:48.88,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}看着吧。没事的。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Just watch. It's fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.91,0:06:50.44,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}是吗？好。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Yeah? Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.48,0:06:51.54,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}嗨。嘿。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Hi. Hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.58,0:06:53.45,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}呃，我们停机了。对。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Uh, we stopped rolling. Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.48,0:06:55.62,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我就一分钟没盯着他，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I took my eyes off him for a minute,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.65,0:06:58.15,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}然后，呃，我们就把他弄丢了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}and, uh, we lost him.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.79,0:07:00.72,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你是谁？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Who are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.75,0:07:01.89,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}丹……呃，第一副导演。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Dan... uh, first A.D.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.92,0:07:03.49,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我们一起干了四年。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}We've worked together for four years.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.52,0:07:05.12,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}好了。你是谁？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}All right. Who are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.16,0:07:07.23,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}呃，山姆，第二副导演。这位是山姆。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Uh, S-Sam, second A.D. This is Sam.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.26,0:07:09.63,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}山姆。山姆，你现在是第一副导演了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Sam. Sam, you're now the first A.D.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.66,0:07:10.90,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你被开除了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You're now fired.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.13,0:07:13.03,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}行吗？收拾你的东西滚蛋。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Okay? I need you to get your crap and get out.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.07,0:07:14.54,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}好。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.57,0:07:16.14,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}切特，我……不，不，不。这不是商量。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Chet, I... No, no, no. It's not a conversation.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.17,0:07:17.84,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我要你离开我的片场，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I need you to get off of my set,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.87,0:07:19.74,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}否则你在这个圈子别想找到工作\N{\rEN\blur0.8}or you're not gonna be able to get a job in this town
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.77,0:07:21.04,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}除了当个吸毒的婊子……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}as anything but a crack whore...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.07,0:07:22.21,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}助理吸毒婊子。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Assistant crack whore.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.24,0:07:23.64,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}助理毒虫妓女。呃，切特，切特。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}An assistant crack whore. Uh, Chet, Chet.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.68,0:07:25.18,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}切特，呃，你能过来一下吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Chet, uh, could you come here, please?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.21,0:07:27.05,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}是啊。呃，你不能就这么走进来\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Yeah. Um, you can't just walk in here
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.08,0:07:28.58,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}然后换掉我经验丰富的副导演。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}and replace my experienced A.D.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.62,0:07:30.12,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}用一个毛头小子。嘿，放松点，奎恩。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}with some kid. Hey, relax, Quinn.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.15,0:07:31.18,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你能搞定。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You got this.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.22,0:07:32.65,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}不不不不不。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}No, no, no, no, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.69,0:07:33.92,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}不像某些人，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Unlike some people,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.95,0:07:35.79,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我可没有十亿美元的王牌节目。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I don't own a billion-dollar franchise.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.82,0:07:38.02,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我得工作养活自己，好吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I have to work for a living, all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.06,0:07:39.19,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我要被炒了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I'm going to get fired.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.23,0:07:40.83,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你不会被炒的。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You're not gonna get fired.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.86,0:07:42.66,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我不会让这种事发生在你身上。我是认真的。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I'm not gonna let that happen to you. I am serious.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.70,0:07:44.26,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}没有亚当，就没有节目。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}No Adam, no show.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.30,0:07:46.27,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这次连你也救不了我。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Even you can't bail me out of this.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.30,0:07:47.70,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}瑞秋！在？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Rachel! Yes?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.74,0:07:49.24,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}去找他。谁？亚当？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Go find him. Who? Adam?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.27,0:07:50.67,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我，呃，我从没……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I, um, I've never e...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.70,0:07:52.14,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我甚至都不知……我从没见过他。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I don't even kno... I've never met him.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.17,0:07:53.74,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你要让这丫头去处理？对。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You're gonna let this one handle it? Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.77,0:07:56.01,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}她是最棒的，你不觉得吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}She's the best, don't you think?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.04,0:07:57.01,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}嘿。嘿。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Hey. Hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.04,0:07:58.55,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}欢迎回来，小怪胎。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Welcome back, little weirdo.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.81,0:08:00.95,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你很幸运，你那点小把戏\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You're very lucky that your little stunt
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.98,0:08:02.65,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}上一季给我挣来了爆表收视率。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}got me booyah ratings last season.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.68,0:08:05.92,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}是啊，那，呃，那确实走运，是啊。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Yeah, that was, uh, that was lucky, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.95,0:08:07.22,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}对。嗯哼。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Yes. Mm-hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.32,0:08:10.56,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你知道吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You know what?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.59,0:08:12.69,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你还没漂亮到能发疯，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You're not hot enough to be crazy,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.73,0:08:17.03,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}所以我需要你保持脑子清醒，好吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}so I need you to keep your brains together, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.06,0:08:19.53,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你，去你办公室，现在。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You, in your office, now.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.57,0:08:21.07,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}好。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.10,0:08:22.80,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}呃，听着，保持对讲机在线，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Uh, listen, stay on walkie,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.84,0:08:24.97,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}找到他就告诉我。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}and let me know when you find him.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.00,0:08:26.07,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}好。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.11,0:08:27.64,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}还有，他不肯签合同。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Also, he wouldn't sign his contract.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.68,0:08:28.78,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}什么？奎恩！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}What? Quinn!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.81,0:08:32.55,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}奎恩，你没签合同就拍他的素材？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Quinn, you shot footage on him without a signed contract?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.58,0:08:34.98,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}他说想先给伦敦的律师看看，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}He said he wanted to show it to his lawyers in London,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.02,0:08:36.55,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}或者什么鬼话，行吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}or some nonsense, all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.58,0:08:37.92,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我还能怎么办？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}What was I supposed to do?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.95,0:08:39.82,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}离日出只有七个半小时，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}We have seven and a half hours before sunrise,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.85,0:08:42.56,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}只有深夜能拍，而我他妈需要一档节目！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}can only shoot in hard night, and I need a frickin' show!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.59,0:08:43.66,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}太好了！所以我……所以我……所以我……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}That's great! So d... So I... So I...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.69,0:08:45.09,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}怎么，我一点筹码都没有？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}What, I have no leverage?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.12,0:08:48.16,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}哦，随便编点东西。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Oh, just make something up.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.20,0:08:49.43,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}干好你的活。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Do your job.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.46,0:08:52.60,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你回来的第一天可不想惹毛我，好吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You do not want to piss me off on your first day back, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.63,0:08:55.70,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}现在就去把我们的节目招牌找来！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Just go get our show pony, now!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.74,0:08:56.87,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}该死。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Damn it.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.81,0:09:08.82,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}亚当。嗨。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Adam. Hi.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.85,0:09:10.62,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}嗨。我是瑞秋。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Hi. I'm Rachel.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.65,0:09:11.68,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}听着，我，呃……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Listen, I, um...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.72,0:09:12.82,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}不，听我说。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}No, look.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.85,0:09:14.09,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我有个朋友要来接我，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I've got a friend coming to pick me up,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.12,0:09:15.82,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我不会改变主意。好吧。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}and I'm not changing my mind. Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.86,0:09:17.12,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}唉。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Ugh.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.16,0:09:20.23,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}哦，我正为老板冒大险呢。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Oh, my ass is just on the line with my boss.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.26,0:09:22.23,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}跟奎恩？不是吧。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}With Quinn? No kidding.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.26,0:09:23.70,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}那女人真是个极品。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}That lady's a piece of work.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.73,0:09:26.27,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}是啊。你根本想象不到。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Yeah. You have no idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.30,0:09:28.14,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}唉。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Ugh.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.70,0:09:32.17,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}那，你觉得我能不能就在这儿待十分钟\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Well, do you think I could just spend 10 minutes up here
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.21,0:09:34.71,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}让我想想被炒了该怎么办？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}while I figure out what to do when I get fired?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.14,0:09:38.24,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}十分钟……不过得安静。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}10 minutes... In silence, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.05,0:09:44.88,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}把另一扇也打开。这里热得要命。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Open the other one. It's hot as balls in here.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.92,0:09:46.15,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}嘿，呃，我能跟你说句话吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Hey, uh, can I have a word?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.19,0:09:48.29,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}呃，走，走，走。快。拜托。你……我……听着。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Ugh, go, go, go. Quick. Come on. Y... I... Look.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.32,0:09:50.82,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}有话直说。快点。我觉得你把瑞秋找回来很棒，真的。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Spit it out. Let's go. I think it's great that you got Rachel back, really.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.86,0:09:53.23,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}呃。我只是有点困惑。我是说，我做错什么了吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Ugh. I guess I'm just confused. I mean, did I do something wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.26,0:09:55.96,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你把我最好的女孩都给了瑞秋。瑞秋总能拿到最好的金句，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You gave all my best girls to Rachel. Rachel gets the best sound bites,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.00,0:09:58.30,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}而且她制造冲突的直觉一流。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}and she has killer instincts for drama.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.33,0:09:59.93,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}她联系你了吗？没有。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Did you hear from her? No.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.97,0:10:02.27,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}好吧，只是她搞砸之后，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Okay, it's just that after she bombed out,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.30,0:10:03.40,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}是我替她收拾烂摊子。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I cleaned up her mess.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.44,0:10:05.84,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我知道，但问题是，希亚，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I know, but the thing is, Shia,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.87,0:10:08.34,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}大家信任她，也喜欢她。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}people trust her, and they like her.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.38,0:10:11.21,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这种东西是教不来的。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}That stuff can't really be taught.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.24,0:10:13.75,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}切特呼叫奎恩。我在等。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Chet to Quinn. I'm waiting.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.78,0:10:15.28,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}糟了！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Crap!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.32,0:10:16.75,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}好。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.78,0:10:18.05,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我来了！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I'm coming!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.08,0:10:21.86,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}谁给切特对讲机了？！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Who gave Chet a walkie?!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.12,0:10:27.66,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}纯粹好奇……安静。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Just out of curiosity... Quiet.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.76,0:10:32.10,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}抱歉，到底是什么这么冒犯\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I'm sorry, what was so offensive
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.13,0:10:35.10,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你高雅的品味，让你非得逃走？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}to your refined sensibilities that you needed to flee?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.14,0:10:36.77,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你看到那场闹剧了吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Did you see that circus?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.80,0:10:39.84,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}还有他们介绍那些糟糕女孩的方式？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}How about the way they introduced those horrible girls?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.87,0:10:41.04,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}更别提奎恩想拍我\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Not to mention the fact that Quinn wants to shoot me
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.07,0:10:42.28,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}光着上身，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}with my shirt off,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.31,0:10:44.31,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}骑着马沿着海滩跑，还喊着：\N{\rEN\blur0.8}riding a horse down the beach, shouting,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.34,0:10:46.81,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}“我今晚要遇到我未来的妻子！”\N{\rEN\blur0.8}"I'm gonna meet my wife tonight!"
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.85,0:10:49.75,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}所以呢？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}And?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.78,0:10:51.95,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你看过这节目吧？——几乎没看过。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-You've seen the show, right?   -Barely.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.98,0:10:53.15,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}奎恩向我保证过，这一季\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Quinn promised me that this season
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.19,0:10:54.29,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}会不一样的。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}was gonna be different, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.32,0:10:56.39,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}哦。好吧。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Oh. Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.42,0:10:57.79,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我是说，你看起来不天真，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I mean, you don't seem naive,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.82,0:11:00.29,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}但我想，考虑到纳帕那件事……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}but I guess, with that whole Napa thing...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.33,0:11:01.26,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}纳帕？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Napa?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.29,0:11:03.30,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}纳帕，我当时……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Napa, I was...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.33,0:11:05.36,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我当时想开一家新酒店，然后……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I was trying to open a new hotel, and...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.40,0:11:07.74,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我自己的，不靠我爸。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}My own, without my father.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.77,0:11:09.24,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}王室帅哥脱裤子和三个……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Royal hottie drops trou with three...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.27,0:11:11.10,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}抱歉，是四个妓女？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Or, I'm sorry, was it four hookers?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.14,0:11:12.27,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}然后还发推特晒自拍？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}And then tweets a selfie?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.30,0:11:13.74,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}去你的。我根本不认识你。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Screw you. I don't know you.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.77,0:11:17.11,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我认识你……至少我知道你的目的。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I know you... Or at least I know your agenda.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.14,0:11:19.98,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你不需要红娘。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You don't need a matchmaker.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.01,0:11:21.31,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你需要危机公关。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You need damage control.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.35,0:11:23.75,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}没人会把钱押在你的酒店上\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Nobody's gonna bet money on your hotel
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.78,0:11:25.89,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}除非你先洗白形象。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}until you rehab your image.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.92,0:11:27.35,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}在《美国周刊》封面上待几周……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}A couple of weeks on the cover of Us Weekly...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.39,0:11:29.06,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}就能搞定。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}That's gonna do the trick.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.46,0:11:32.36,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}三频道是谁？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Who's on channel three?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.39,0:11:33.96,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}喂？！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Hello?!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.99,0:11:35.80,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}好了好了，冷静。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Okay. Okay. Calm down.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.83,0:11:37.76,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我最讨厌瑞秋关对讲机。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I hate it when Rachel goes off walkie.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.80,0:11:38.87,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我知道。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.90,0:11:40.43,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我这是想让你放松点。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You know, I'm trying to get you to relax a little bit.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.47,0:11:42.17,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}好了，你能行，你能行。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Okay. You got this. You got this.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.20,0:11:43.84,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你会成功的，你会想出办法的。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You'll get it. You'll figure it out.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.87,0:11:46.04,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你是我的小女王。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You're my little queen.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.07,0:11:47.14,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}天啊。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Oh, God.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.17,0:11:49.04,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}别废话了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}So cut the crap.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.08,0:11:51.08,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你到底要怎样才肯签合同，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}What's it gonna take for you to sign the contract,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.11,0:11:52.34,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}直说吧？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}straight-up?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.15,0:11:55.88,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}嗯……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Well, um...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.92,0:11:57.32,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我得考虑考虑。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I'd have to think about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.35,0:11:58.85,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}好。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.89,0:12:00.25,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这样行不通。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}It's just not gonna work.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.29,0:12:03.52,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}呃，我们有个备选。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Uh, we have a backup guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.56,0:12:07.03,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}还有备选？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}There's a backup guy?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.06,0:12:09.76,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}对，一个无国界医生的……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Yeah, some, uh, Doctors Without Borders guy
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.80,0:12:11.80,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}好像找到了疟疾的解药之类。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}who found a cure for malaria or something.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.83,0:12:12.73,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}哇。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Oh, wow.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.77,0:12:14.20,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}疟疾……那是我支持的公益之一。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Malaria... that's... That's one of my causes.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.23,0:12:15.40,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我……我很想见见他。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I would... I would love to meet him.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.44,0:12:17.14,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}太好了，酷。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Awesome. Cool.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.17,0:12:19.27,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}他大概十分钟后去化妆。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Yeah, he'll, uh, be in makeup in about 10 minutes.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.31,0:12:21.17,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}干杯。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Cheers.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.21,0:12:22.44,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我们都得尿尿！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}We all have to pee!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.48,0:12:23.41,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}对，失陪一下。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Yeah. Excuse me.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.44,0:12:25.01,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}求你了，放我们出去。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Please, let us out.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.04,0:12:27.78,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}嗨，多萝西，这真的很重要。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Hi. Dorothy, this is really important.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.82,0:12:29.38,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我们要尿尿。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}We have to pee.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.42,0:12:31.08,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我知道，很抱歉，我……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I know. I'm so sorry. I...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.12,0:12:32.38,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}好吧，你知道吗？哦！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Okay, well, you know what? Oh!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.42,0:12:33.89,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我们很快的，我保证。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}We'll be really fast, I promise.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.92,0:12:35.49,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}天啊。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Oh, my God.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.56,0:12:39.23,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}哎呀呀！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Ay-yi-yi!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.26,0:12:42.23,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}好了，天啊。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Okay. Oh, God.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.26,0:12:43.53,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}天啊，我要尿裤子了\N{\rEN\blur0.8}God, I'm gonna piss my myself
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.56,0:12:45.97,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我太需要这个了！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I needed this!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.37,0:12:51.00,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}天啊！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Oh, my God!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.04,0:12:51.90,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}哇。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Whoa.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.94,0:12:53.97,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}牛仔竞技女孩是不准做蜜蜡脱毛吗，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Are rodeo girls, like, not allowed to wax,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.01,0:12:56.38,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}还是怎样？拜托，嘴下留情。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}or something? Come on, be nice.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.41,0:12:58.51,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}那哪是草丛，简直是灌木丛！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}That's not a bush, that's a freakin' shrub!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.54,0:13:00.58,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}好了，拜托。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Okay, come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.61,0:13:02.22,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我车里好像有剃刀。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I think I have a razor in the car.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.25,0:13:03.52,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你要吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Do you want it?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.55,0:13:04.75,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}拜托，嘴下留情。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Come on, be nice.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.78,0:13:06.99,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}拜托，回车里吧。我已经很客气了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Please, just get back in the car, please. I am being nice.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.02,0:13:09.16,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我是想帮她。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I'm trying to help her out.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.62,0:13:12.42,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-给你。  -麦克风测试！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-Here you go.   -Mike check!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.46,0:13:14.39,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}谢谢。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.43,0:13:15.43,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}瑞秋。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Rachel.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.46,0:13:16.93,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}嘿，嗨。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Hey. Hi.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.96,0:13:18.53,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你回来这里到底在想什么？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}What the hell are you thinking, coming back here?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.56,0:13:20.40,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}抱歉。杰瑞米，对不起，我……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Sorry. Yeah, I'm... Jeremy, I'm sorry that I, um...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.43,0:13:22.54,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}哦，你不声不响地消失了？是啊。嗯……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Oh, that you disappeared without saying a word? Yeah. Um...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.57,0:13:25.14,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}瑞秋，你到底在哪？我得……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Uh, Rachel. Where the hell are you? You know, I got to...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.17,0:13:26.47,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我得走了，因为……对，我知道。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I have to go, because... Yeah, I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.51,0:13:28.24,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}同一个对讲频道。她在……好。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Uh, same walkie channel. She's making... Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.28,0:13:30.41,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}但是瑞秋，说真的，搞什么？我打了很多电话。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}But, Rachel, seriously, what the hell? I called, like, a lot.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.44,0:13:31.84,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}是啊，我只是……我没有……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Yeah, I just... I didn't...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.88,0:13:33.15,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我没带手机，我真的没有。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I didn't have my phone. I-I didn't.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.18,0:13:34.48,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你洗澡都把手机装密封袋里。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You shower with your phone in a Ziploc bag.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.51,0:13:36.85,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}行了，杰瑞米。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Okay, Jeremy.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.88,0:13:39.52,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我们本来没打算被困在墨西哥，好吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}We weren't supposed to get stuck in Mexico, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.55,0:13:41.86,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}而且我当时，嗯，累极了，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}And I was, um, profoundly exhausted,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.89,0:13:43.56,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}还晒伤了，而且我……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}and I was sunburned, and I...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.59,0:13:45.89,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}最后还用白葡萄酒洗澡。等等，你是不是……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Bathing in white wine by the end of it. Hold it. Wait. Did you...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.93,0:13:48.06,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你刚才是把晒伤当成……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Did you just use being sunburned as...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.10,0:13:50.06,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}当成不……的借口？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}As an excuse for not...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.10,0:13:52.06,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}真不敢相信。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}That's unbelievable.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.10,0:13:54.03,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}是啊。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.07,0:13:56.20,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}好吧，显然我们得一起工作，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Okay, obviously, we have to work together,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.24,0:13:59.24,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}所以……不工作的时候离我远点，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}so just... stay away from me when we're not...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.27,0:14:00.44,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}好，行。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Yeah. Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.47,0:14:04.34,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我是说，你知道，我不出差，所以……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I mean, you know, I'm not traveling, so...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.38,0:14:05.64,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}很好。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Good.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.68,0:14:08.08,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}嗯，好。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Yep. Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.68,0:14:13.95,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}哦，我看到你和莉齐复合了，对吧？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Oh, I saw that you and Lizzie got back together, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.99,0:14:16.06,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}怎么，你给她找了份工作\N{\rEN\blur0.8}And, what, did you, like, get her a job
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.09,0:14:17.59,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}在节目里，还是……？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}on the show, or...?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.62,0:14:18.76,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}对。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.79,0:14:21.16,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}她一直想离开美容院，所以……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I mean, she's been trying to leave the salon forever, so...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.19,0:14:24.53,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}把女朋友弄到上班的地方，真可爱！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}That's so cute, having your girlfriend at work!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.56,0:14:26.00,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}拖车……她是未婚妻。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}The trailer... It's fiancée.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.03,0:14:27.33,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}等等，什么？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Wait, what?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.37,0:14:29.40,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}她是我未婚妻。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}She's my fiancée.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.37,0:14:33.57,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我打过电话了，瑞秋。嗯，对。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I called, Rach. Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.61,0:14:36.51,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}瑞秋！泳池边！马上！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Rachel! Pool! Now!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.54,0:14:39.51,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}正在飞过来。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Flying in.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.65,0:14:50.09,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}根本没有什么备用疟疾医生，对吧？不信你问我。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}There is no backup malaria doctor, is there? Try me.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.12,0:14:51.56,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}瑞秋，到底怎么回事？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Rachel, what the hell is happening?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.59,0:14:53.06,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我们每耽搁一分钟……你能不能冷静点。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Every minute we're not shooting... Can you calm down.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.09,0:14:54.16,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}拜托，好吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Please, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.19,0:14:56.36,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我跟他说了那个备用的人。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I told him about the backup guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.40,0:14:59.30,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}什么备用的人？我们根本没有备……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}What backup guy? We don't have a back...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.13,0:15:02.14,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}漂亮。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Nice.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.17,0:15:04.24,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你觉得他信了吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Do you think he bought it?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.27,0:15:07.27,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我觉得我们现在走开，就能知道。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I think we walk away right now, we find out.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.31,0:15:08.24,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}好。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.28,0:15:09.68,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}呃，把那个备用的人带进来！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Uh, bring in the backup guy!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.71,0:15:12.95,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}该死。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Shit.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.98,0:15:15.15,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}大家动起来！哦，看这些蜡烛。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Let's go, people! Oh, look at the candles.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.18,0:15:16.55,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我来。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I'll do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.45,0:15:21.09,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}但其中一次约会必须在我纳帕的酒店场地。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}But one of the dates has to be at my hotel site in Napa.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.12,0:15:22.29,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我要保证拍到招牌的镜头\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I want guaranteed shots of the signs
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.32,0:15:23.66,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}还要口头提到酒店名字。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}and a verbal mention of the hotel name.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.69,0:15:25.42,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}啊哈。新要求。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Aha. New demands.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.46,0:15:28.16,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}当然。没问题，行吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Of course. Done, all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.20,0:15:30.36,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}现在回去干活吧，你这英国佬混蛋。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Now just get back to work, you limey prick.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.40,0:15:32.60,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}她真迷人。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}She's charming.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.63,0:15:35.47,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}不行，他们还没准备好！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}No, they're not ready!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.50,0:15:37.54,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}好。又来了……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Okay. Here we go...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.57,0:15:38.67,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}又一次。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}again.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.70,0:15:39.67,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这次肯定精彩。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}This one's gonna be good.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.71,0:15:40.71,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}好，摄影机开机！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Okay, cameras rolling!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.74,0:15:43.38,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}声音就位！摄影就位！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Sound speed! Camera speed!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.41,0:15:45.01,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}好，然后……开拍。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Okay, and... action.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.04,0:15:46.58,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}好了。开始。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}All right. Here we go.
