Dialogue: 0,0:31:00.56,0:31:03.16,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你，跟我来，马上。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You, follow me, now.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:03.20,0:31:05.90,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}嘿，帅哥，过来一下。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Hey, pretty boy, come here, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:07.37,0:31:08.43,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}嗨。嗯。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Hi. Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:08.47,0:31:11.24,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}呃，听着，你把我的反派淘汰了，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Um, listen, you cut my villain,
Dialogue: 0,0:31:11.27,0:31:13.14,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}而没有反派，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}and I can't make a television show
Dialogue: 0,0:31:13.17,0:31:14.51,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我做不了电视节目。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}without a villain.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:14.54,0:31:16.38,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你事先知道吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Did you know about this?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:16.41,0:31:17.91,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}哦，不，那不是她的主意。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Oh, no, that wasn't her.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:17.94,0:31:19.61,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我只是顺从自己的心意。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I just did what I felt in my heart.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:21.28,0:31:23.32,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你的心意？得了吧。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Your heart? Please.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:23.35,0:31:25.08,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}好，别担心，好吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Okay, don't worry about it, all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:25.12,0:31:26.48,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}交给我。这会是很棒的电视效果。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I got it. It's gonna be good TV.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:26.52,0:31:28.05,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}喂？！滚出去！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Hello?! Get out of here!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:28.09,0:31:29.56,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我不录这破节目了！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I'm off the freakin' show!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:29.59,0:31:30.19,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}好，就……就……镜头继续对着她，好吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}All right, just... just... Just keep it on her, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:30.22,0:31:31.12,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我不录这破节目了！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I'm off the freakin' show!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:31.16,0:31:34.43,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}镜头对着她。退后！退后！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Keep it on her. Stand down! Stand down!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:34.46,0:31:37.63,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}布兰妮。布兰妮，你听我说，好吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Britney. Britney, you listen to me, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:37.66,0:31:42.27,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}如果你现在走人，最后得意的就是他们。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}If you walk away right now, they're gonna get the last word.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:44.24,0:31:46.50,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这是你想要的吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Is that what you want?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:49.41,0:31:51.14,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}来吧。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:57.58,0:31:58.92,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这就对了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}There you go.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:00.59,0:32:02.55,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}感觉好吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Do you feel good?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:02.59,0:32:04.59,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我感觉很好。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I feel great.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:04.62,0:32:06.96,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}呃，好吧。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Eh. Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:06.99,0:32:09.46,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我来吧。谢谢。你真漂亮。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I got it. Thank you. You look really pretty.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:09.50,0:32:11.66,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}哦，这不是很讽刺吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Well, isn't that ironic?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:11.70,0:32:13.23,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你准备好拍摄了吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You ready to shoot?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:13.26,0:32:15.63,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}是啊，我等不及了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Yeah. I can't wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:15.67,0:32:18.50,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}开始录了吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Are we rolling?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:18.54,0:32:21.14,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}好。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:23.11,0:32:25.64,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你不如直接告诉我今晚这里发生了什么？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Why don't you just tell me what happened here tonight?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:30.38,0:32:32.52,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}他真是个好人，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}He's such a great guy,
Dialogue: 0,0:32:32.55,0:32:36.02,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我在节目里过得很开心。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}and I've had a lovely time on the show.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:40.06,0:32:42.33,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我会循环重复这句话\N{\rEN\blur0.8}And I'm gonna repeat that on loop
Dialogue: 0,0:32:42.36,0:32:47.50,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}直到你让我回家，瑞秋。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}until you let me go home, Rachel.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:50.37,0:32:53.70,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}呃，瑞秋？瑞秋？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Um, uh, Rachel? Rachel?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:55.54,0:32:58.68,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}等一下，好吗？就给我一秒。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}One second, all right? Just give me one sec.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:58.71,0:33:00.48,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}慢慢来。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Take your time.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:00.51,0:33:02.71,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}瑞秋在。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Go for Rachel.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:02.75,0:33:06.25,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}瑞秋，呃，我不知道这有没有用\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Rachel, uh, I don't know if this is gonna be helpful
Dialogue: 0,0:33:06.28,0:33:08.29,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}但21号对象是被收养的\N{\rEN\blur0.8}but Subject 21 was adopted
Dialogue: 0,0:33:08.32,0:33:11.22,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}还在寄养系统待了好多年。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}and was in foster care for years.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:11.26,0:33:13.66,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}呃，她16岁就独立了，而且……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Uh, she was emancipated at 16, and...
Dialogue: 0,0:33:13.69,0:33:18.46,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}哦，她进过，呃，她进过两次精神病院。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}oh, she was in, uh, uh, she was in a psych ward twice.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:18.50,0:33:21.13,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}那你还让她上节目？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}And yet you let her on the show?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:21.17,0:33:22.70,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}哦。呃，我……好吧，瑞秋，我……不，切断。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Oh. Um, I... Okay, Rachel, I... No, just cut out.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:22.73,0:33:24.07,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}松手。松开按钮。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Just let go. Let go of the button.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:24.10,0:33:26.10,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我……松手！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I... Let go!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:26.14,0:33:29.04,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}算了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Never mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:38.75,0:33:40.19,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}没事了吧？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}We good?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:49.36,0:33:50.43,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}好了，你知道吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Okay, you know what?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:50.46,0:33:52.06,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我不……我不……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I don't... I don't...
Dialogue: 0,0:33:52.10,0:33:55.20,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我和你一样不想干这种破事。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I don't want to be doing this crap any more than you do.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:55.23,0:33:57.50,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我也不想。杰瑞米，你能不能停下？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I don't. Jeremy, can you just stop?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:57.54,0:33:58.74,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}请别拍了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Stop filming, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:58.77,0:34:00.81,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}就关掉……把摄像机放下，好吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Just turn... Put the camera down, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:00.84,0:34:03.31,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}停止拍摄。我们结束了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Stop rolling. We're finished.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:03.34,0:34:07.15,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}只是……我……我，呃……天啊，这感觉太好了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Just... I... I, uh... God, that feels so good.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:07.18,0:34:09.48,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}哇，好吧。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Wow, okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:09.52,0:34:11.35,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我只是……谁能给我拿杯酒？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I just... Can someone get me a drink?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:11.38,0:34:14.35,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}谁能给我拿杯酒，拜托？！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Can somebody get me a drink, please?!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:14.39,0:34:15.39,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我，呃……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I, uh...
Dialogue: 0,0:34:15.42,0:34:16.39,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我去拿。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I'm on it.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:16.42,0:34:17.82,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}天啊。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Oh, my God.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:20.36,0:34:24.50,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}走吧。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:24.53,0:34:27.10,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}好，好吧。走吧。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Yeah, okay. Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:28.77,0:34:30.57,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}天啊。日出真烂。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Oh, my God. Sunrise sucks.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:30.60,0:34:33.70,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}今天谁能给我们拿杯酒来？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Can somebody please get us a drink today?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:33.74,0:34:35.21,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}什么？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:35.24,0:34:36.38,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}谢谢。瑞秋在干什么？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Thank you. What is Rachel doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:36.41,0:34:37.71,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}谢谢。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:37.74,0:34:39.74,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}不客气。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You're welcome.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:47.39,0:34:51.66,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}所有人都在评判你。这太不公平了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Everybody judges you. It's, like, so unfair.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:51.69,0:34:53.69,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我？嗯哼。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Me? Mm-hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:53.72,0:34:57.30,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}不。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:57.33,0:34:59.40,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I...
Dialogue: 0,0:34:59.43,0:35:01.33,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我评判所有人。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I judge everyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:01.37,0:35:03.57,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}不，你完全是个软心肠，我看得出来。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}No, you're a total softie, I can tell.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:03.60,0:35:06.14,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}对吧？你大概……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Right? You probably...
Dialogue: 0,0:35:06.17,0:35:09.14,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你大概喜欢狗、小狗，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You probably like, like, dogs, and puppies,
Dialogue: 0,0:35:09.18,0:35:11.51,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}还有彩虹和独角兽。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}and rainbows, and unicorns.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:11.54,0:35:13.28,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我说得对吧？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Am I right?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:13.31,0:35:16.35,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这世上只有你会这么想。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You're the only person on the planet that thinks that.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:16.38,0:35:20.25,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我确定你父母看得到你那颗柔软的小心脏。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I'm sure your parents see your tender little heart.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:22.45,0:35:23.55,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}什么？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:23.59,0:35:24.62,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}没什么。算了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Nothing. Never mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:24.66,0:35:26.32,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}总之……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Anyways...
Dialogue: 0,0:35:28.63,0:35:31.80,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}从一个荡妇敬另一个荡妇。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}From one slut to another.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:32.60,0:35:33.93,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}干杯。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Cheers.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:33.96,0:35:35.40,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你刚才叫我荡妇？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Did you just call me a slut?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:35.43,0:35:37.84,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}好。这个我能用。这个我能用。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Okay. I can use that. I can use that.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:37.87,0:35:40.77,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}不，我只是叫我自己荡妇。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}No. I just called myself a slut.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:42.81,0:35:44.34,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}对。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:45.51,0:35:46.81,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}嘿，听我说。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Hey, listen.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:46.84,0:35:53.25,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}呃，他……他有跟你说什么吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Um, did he... did he say something to you?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:53.28,0:35:55.69,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}亚当？嗯……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Adam? Mm...
Dialogue: 0,0:35:55.72,0:35:59.66,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}也……也没说得特别具体……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Like, not... not super specifically...
Dialogue: 0,0:35:59.69,0:36:04.30,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我是说，但是你知道，你确实有点太主动了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I mean, but, you know, you did come on kind of strong.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:06.33,0:36:07.40,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你让我这么做的。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You told me to.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:07.43,0:36:08.83,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我没让你……对，你……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I did not tell you... Yes, you...
Dialogue: 0,0:36:08.87,0:36:10.97,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}去跟他舌吻，还抓他屁股。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}to, like, French him and grab his ass.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:11.00,0:36:12.60,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}哇。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Wow.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:15.34,0:36:18.51,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你真是不一般，瑞秋。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You're something else, Rachel.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:18.54,0:36:19.61,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我不知道。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:19.64,0:36:20.95,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你觉得你这么主动\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Do you think that you're, like, forward
Dialogue: 0,0:36:20.98,0:36:22.61,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}是因为，呃……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}because of, um...
Dialogue: 0,0:36:22.65,0:36:25.85,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你成长过程中发生的那些事吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}things that happened in your upbringing?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:25.88,0:36:27.89,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你在说什么？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}What are you talking about?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:27.92,0:36:30.26,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我只是说，就像，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I was just saying that, like,
Dialogue: 0,0:36:30.29,0:36:31.89,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你知道，当坏事发生时，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}you know, when bad things go down,
Dialogue: 0,0:36:31.92,0:36:35.89,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}有时候你小孩的脑袋会把它理解成，呃……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}sometimes your kid brain computes it as, like, um...
Dialogue: 0,0:36:35.93,0:36:38.50,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我不知道。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:38.53,0:36:40.93,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}“我一定是不值得被爱的。”\N{\rEN\blur0.8}"I must be unlovable."
Dialogue: 0,0:37:00.42,0:37:02.22,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}当心。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Heads up.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:10.80,0:37:15.87,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I am...
Dialogue: 0,0:37:15.90,0:37:19.37,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}完全……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}completely...
Dialogue: 0,0:37:19.41,0:37:22.04,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}值得被爱。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}loveable.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:29.98,0:37:33.42,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}下地狱吧，你这个巫婆！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Burn in hell, you witch!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:42.43,0:37:44.96,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你们全都下地狱去吧！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}All of you, just burn in hell!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:49.80,0:37:51.64,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}靠，这段太棒了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Damn, that was good.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:51.67,0:37:54.51,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这段能剪进宣传片。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}We can use that in a promo.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:54.54,0:37:56.68,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}瑞秋回来了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Rachel's back.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:57.98,0:38:00.55,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我怎么跟你说的？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}What did I tell you?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:00.58,0:38:02.78,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你总能搞定。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You always make it work.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:21.87,0:38:25.40,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}嘿，第一晚怎么样？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Oh, hey. So, how was your first night?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:25.44,0:38:28.01,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}疯了，我累死了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Crazy. I'm so tired.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:28.04,0:38:30.74,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我一整晚都没上过厕所，也没坐下过。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I don't think I peed or sat down once all night.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:30.78,0:38:32.34,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}是啊，就是这样。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Yeah, that's how it goes.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:32.38,0:38:34.81,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}肾上腺素会让有些人发疯。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You know, adrenaline makes some people loco.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:34.85,0:38:35.91,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}是啊。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:35.95,0:38:39.58,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我今天好像听到有人在说瑞秋的事。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Um, I kind of heard some talk today about Rachel.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:40.79,0:38:42.62,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}杰瑞米没告诉过你发生了什么？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Jeremy never told you what happened?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:42.65,0:38:45.09,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}真的？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:45.12,0:38:46.99,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你可是他未婚妻啊。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Well, you're his fiancée.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:47.02,0:38:49.96,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你该看看，简直史诗级。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You should see it, 'cause it's epic.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:55.50,0:38:57.47,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}克莱尔，这八周是我人生中最美好的时光。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Claire, the last eight weeks have been the best of my life.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:57.50,0:38:59.70,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我们分享的一切，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}The things that we've shared,
Dialogue: 0,0:38:59.74,0:39:03.11,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我们经历的一切，让我们如此亲密。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}the experiences that we've had, have brought us so close.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:03.14,0:39:06.14,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}还有我们做的那些事，那些……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Other things that we did, the...
Dialogue: 0,0:39:06.18,0:39:08.45,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}瑞秋，别！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Rachel, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:08.48,0:39:09.68,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}过去……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Past...
Dialogue: 0,0:39:09.72,0:39:11.68,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}她在干什么？我不知道。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}What is she doing? I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:11.72,0:39:14.39,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这工作……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}This job...
Dialogue: 0,0:39:14.42,0:39:16.96,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这工作就是撒旦的屁眼！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}this job is Satan's asshole!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:16.99,0:39:18.16,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}瑞秋，别这样！你在干什么？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Rachel, don't do this! What are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:18.19,0:39:19.66,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你疯了吗？我……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Are you crazy? I...
Dialogue: 0,0:39:19.69,0:39:20.89,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}天哪，你脑子进水了吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Oh, hell. Are you at of your mind?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:20.93,0:39:24.13,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你，天哪，你……克莱尔。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You. My God, you... Claire.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:24.16,0:39:25.83,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}克莱尔，你也是别人家的孩子。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Claire, you're somebody's child.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:25.86,0:39:27.77,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}不，瑞秋，瑞秋，别这样！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}No, Rachel, Rachel, don't do this!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:27.80,0:39:28.90,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}嗯？你在干什么？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Hm? What are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:28.93,0:39:30.97,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}别这样，放开她。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Don't do this. Let her go.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:31.00,0:39:33.44,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}他马上要甩了你。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}He's about to dump you.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:33.47,0:39:34.84,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}不。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:34.87,0:39:36.07,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}是真的吗？！不，不！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Is that true?! No, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:36.11,0:39:37.18,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你要甩了我？！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You're dumping me?!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:38.81,0:39:39.95,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}天哪。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Oh, my God.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:39.98,0:39:41.88,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这段没播。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}They didn't air this.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:41.91,0:39:44.11,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}没有，他们把疯婆子剪掉了\N{\rEN\blur0.8}No, no, they cut crazy pants
Dialogue: 0,0:39:44.15,0:39:46.62,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}剪得好像是这个被甩的姑娘发了疯……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}and made it look like the dumped girl goes mental...
Dialogue: 0,0:39:46.65,0:39:47.99,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}大结局收视爆棚。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Huge finale ratings.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:48.02,0:39:50.92,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我发誓，瑞秋踩到狗屎都能踩出金子。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I swear, Rachel slips in shit and lands in money.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:50.96,0:39:52.62,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}把钥匙给我！别！嘿，嘿，嘿！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Give me the keys! Don't! Hey, hey, hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:53.93,0:39:55.66,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}嘿！嘿，停车！停车！我不走。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Hey! Hey, stop! Stop! I'm not gonna move.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:55.69,0:39:56.70,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}不，不。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}No, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:56.73,0:39:58.03,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你得带我一起走。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You're taking me with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:58.06,0:40:01.00,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}等等，等等。瑞秋！瑞秋！等等！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Wait, wait. Rach! Rachel! Wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:40:02.50,0:40:03.84,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这段能用。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}We can use that.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:03.87,0:40:05.14,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}嘿，杰瑞米。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Hey, Jeremy.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:05.17,0:40:07.61,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}脑子疯，床上也疯，对吧？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Crazy in the head, crazy in bed, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:20.55,0:40:21.82,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}什么？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:21.85,0:40:23.96,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你们就没谁有过倒霉的一天吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}None of you have ever had a bad day?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:25.26,0:40:27.83,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}滚出去。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Get out.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:27.86,0:40:30.60,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}好了，来吧各位，去签退。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}All right, come on, you guys, let's go sign out.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:30.63,0:40:33.76,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}嘿，那个，是啊，你……你没必要那么做的。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Hey, uh, yeah, you just... You didn't have to do that.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:33.80,0:40:37.04,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}有必要。我需要你全心全意投入工作。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Yes, I did. I need your head in the game.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:37.07,0:40:41.51,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}好，你能不能签一下这份文件\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Okay, um, can you just sign this paperwork
Dialogue: 0,0:40:41.54,0:40:43.91,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}证明我准时到岗而且没喝酒？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}saying that I showed up to work on time and sober?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:43.94,0:40:46.04,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}因为，嗯，我得赶公交\N{\rEN\blur0.8}'Cause, um, I have to catch a bus
Dialogue: 0,0:40:46.08,0:40:47.75,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}去做社区服务，然后去心理治疗。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}to community service, and then therapy.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:47.78,0:40:51.75,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}天哪，我这么惊艳也是挺累人的。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Oh, my God, it hurts, actually, to be this fabulous.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:51.78,0:40:54.08,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}其实不用，我都处理好了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Actually, you don't. I handled it.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:54.12,0:40:56.19,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你处理了什么，奎恩？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You handled what, Quinn?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:56.22,0:40:59.56,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}什么？酒驾还是偷车？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}What? The D.U.I., or grand theft auto?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:59.59,0:41:02.53,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}因为这两件事根本都处理不了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Because neither of those things can actually be handled.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:02.56,0:41:05.10,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}可现在都处理好了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}And yet it's handled.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:06.53,0:41:10.04,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}好吧，那个，听着，心理治疗其实挺有用的。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}All right, um, look, the therapy was actually kind of helping.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:10.07,0:41:12.64,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}第一，你没事，第二，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Uh, one, you're fine, and, two,
Dialogue: 0,0:41:12.67,0:41:14.91,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我让法院把你的“精神治疗”\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I had the courts transfer your "psychiatric care"
Dialogue: 0,0:41:14.94,0:41:16.07,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}转到瓦格斯坦这儿了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}to Wagerstein.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:16.11,0:41:17.91,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}转到瓦格斯坦这儿？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}To Wagerstein?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:17.94,0:41:19.61,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}那女人疯了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}That woman's crazy.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:19.64,0:41:22.21,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}那女人就在这儿，好吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}That woman is here, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:22.25,0:41:23.85,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}所以你随时都能去。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}So you can go whenever you want.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:25.62,0:41:27.65,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我需要我的猛龙好好休息。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I need my dragon well-rested.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:30.99,0:41:32.86,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你知道，如果你真要我好好休息，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You know, if you really wanted me well-rested,
Dialogue: 0,0:41:32.89,0:41:35.79,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你可以，嗯……你可以让节目组\N{\rEN\blur0.8}you could, um... you could just get the show
Dialogue: 0,0:41:35.83,0:41:38.00,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}撤诉。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}to drop the charges.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:38.03,0:41:39.66,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我是说，车你们也拿回来了，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I mean, you guys got the car back,
Dialogue: 0,0:41:39.70,0:41:42.27,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}而且……而且我在赔\N{\rEN\blur0.8}and... and I'm... And I'm paying off
Dialogue: 0,0:41:42.30,0:41:43.94,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}所有的损失，还有……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}all of the damages, and...
Dialogue: 0,0:41:45.04,0:41:46.54,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你知道，坐牢的威胁，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}you know, the threat of jail time,
Dialogue: 0,0:41:46.57,0:41:49.94,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这可没法让我晚上睡好觉。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}that's not exactly helping me sleep at night.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:49.98,0:41:52.68,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我知道。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:52.71,0:41:53.91,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}但在我做这些之前，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}But before I can do that,
Dialogue: 0,0:41:53.95,0:41:55.98,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我得看到你从中吸取了教训，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I need to see that you have learned from this,
Dialogue: 0,0:41:56.01,0:41:58.98,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}看到你能改变。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}and that you can change.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:59.02,0:42:01.32,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}信不信由你……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Believe it or not...
Dialogue: 0,0:42:01.35,0:42:02.95,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我很在乎你。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I care about you.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:05.16,0:42:06.69,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}真好笑，因为现在\N{\rEN\blur0.8}That's funny, 'cause right now,
Dialogue: 0,0:42:06.72,0:42:09.06,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}感觉有点像敲诈。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}it feels a little like blackmail.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:11.76,0:42:14.03,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这首曲子你想放多远？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}How far do you want that track?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:14.06,0:42:15.20,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}好了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:18.60,0:42:20.97,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}嘿，嘿，嘿。嘿，嘿。哦。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Hey, hey, hey. Hey, hey. Oh.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:22.24,0:42:24.18,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}谢谢你。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:29.72,0:42:30.75,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}什么都别说。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Don't say anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:30.78,0:42:31.95,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我本来也没打算说。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I wasn't gonna say anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:31.98,0:42:33.18,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}是啊，可你在说啊。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Yeah, but you're talking.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:33.22,0:42:38.26,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}它在你脑海里。* 无眠地拥抱\N{\rEN\blur0.8}It's in your head. * Sleeplessly embracing
Dialogue: 0,0:42:38.29,0:42:39.99,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}好了，各位，听好！* 蝴蝶\N{\rEN\blur0.8}All right, people, listen up! * Butterflies
Dialogue: 0,0:42:40.02,0:42:42.26,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}* 针线排列 史蒂文·斯科特！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}* And needles line Steven Scott!
Dialogue: 0,0:42:42.29,0:42:43.93,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}到。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Here.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:43.96,0:42:44.93,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}吉姆·勒布朗！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Jim Leblanc!
Dialogue: 0,0:42:44.96,0:42:45.93,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}到。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Here.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:45.96,0:42:49.70,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}瑞秋·戈德堡！瑞秋·戈德堡！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Rachel Goldberg! Rachel Goldberg!
Dialogue: 0,0:42:49.74,0:42:52.24,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}哦，那……那是我。呃……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Oh, that... that's me. Uh...
Dialogue: 0,0:42:52.27,0:42:53.87,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}嗯。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Hm.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:53.91,0:42:55.67,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}* 无眠地拥抱 丹尼·普莱斯！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}* Sleeplessly embracing Danny Price!
Dialogue: 0,0:42:55.71,0:42:57.01,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}到。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Here.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:57.04,0:42:59.74,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}好了，女士们，回你们的房间吧。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}All right, ladies. Head up to your rooms.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:02.25,0:43:05.12,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}* 松树的饥渴\N{\rEN\blur0.8}* Hunger of the pine
Dialogue: 0,0:43:05.15,0:43:06.75,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}怎么了？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}What's going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:06.78,0:43:08.12,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}闭嘴。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Just shut up.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:13.22,0:43:17.66,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}* 无眠地拥抱\N{\rEN\blur0.8}* Sleeplessly embracing
Dialogue: 0,0:43:17.70,0:43:20.70,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}* 哈欠渴望着侵入我\N{\rEN\blur0.8}* Yawn yearns into me
Dialogue: 0,0:43:20.73,0:43:22.93,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}* 海里还有更多的眼泪\N{\rEN\blur0.8}* Plenty more tears in the sea
Dialogue: 0,0:43:22.97,0:43:27.84,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}* 于是你终于用上了它\N{\rEN\blur0.8}* And so you finally use it
Dialogue: 0,0:43:27.87,0:43:30.31,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}* 夜里你与我同床共枕 *\N{\rEN\blur0.8}* Bedding with me you see at night *
